<title>SINGAPORE: Popular 1996/97 year profit up 36 pct.</title>
<headline>Popular 1996/97 year profit up 36 pct.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-07-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to April 30, 1997</p>
<p>		   (in millions of S$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit			     7.86  vs	 5.76</p>
<p>    Group shr (cents)		    3.49  vs	 2.56</p>
<p>    Group shr fully diluted (cents)  2.62  vs	 1.92</p>
<p>    Turnover			     161.75  vs     126.36</p>
<p>    Other income incl. interest	0.03  vs	 0.02</p>
<p>    Interest (expense)		   1.66  vs	 1.35</p>
<p>    Depreciation and amortisation    3.12  vs	 2.68</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit			14.79  vs	11.90</p>
<p>    Tax					2.15  vs	 2.11</p>
<p>Note - Popular Holdings Ltd will continue to expand its core business of publishing, retail and distribution by opening new bookstores and adding on more franchise outlets. The group will further develop its new business in office products. It expects performance for the current financial year to be satisfactory.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65 8703080)</p>
</text>
